  description: "Records an actor/key/payload-bound provision receipt, prepares the provider account, and saves its exact identity locally. Completed exact replay returns the recorded user; changed payload under the key conflicts. No password is returned and no company/portal membership is assigned. Incomplete provider/local results need the original receipt and fresh source review; external creation is not claimed atomically rolled back.",
